 2-4  Directories & Assignments
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
      A) Directories  (Some Required, others definable)
         ~~~~~~~~~~~
         ACCOUNTS    -- Defineable path, Used by all nodes.
                        Contains 2 sub directories:
                        APPLICATIONS - New User application answers.
